1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,888
After the walls are done, a new round begins.

2
00:00:03,208 --> 00:00:04,786
Here's how to get it ready.

3
00:00:05,799 --> 00:00:08,423
Nobody has filled a whole row of their wall yet.

4
00:00:08,743 --> 00:00:10,301
So we play another round.

5
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:13,609
Ana has the starting player marker.

6
00:00:13,929 --> 00:00:15,998
So she fills the factory displays.

7
00:00:18,316 --> 00:00:22,050
She draws four tiles for each display, just like at the start.

8
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:24,754
Oh!

9
00:00:25,074 --> 00:00:26,951
The bag runs empty halfway.

10
00:00:30,316 --> 00:00:33,495
So pour every tile from the box lid into the bag.

11
00:00:33,815 --> 00:00:34,818
Mix them up.

12
00:00:38,816 --> 00:00:42,144
Then keep filling, until each display has four tiles.

13
00:00:42,966 --> 00:00:46,166
The box lid is only emptied when the bag runs out.

14
00:00:46,486 --> 00:00:48,150
Never at any other time.

15
00:00:49,266 --> 00:00:52,658
Very rarely, the bag and the box lid are both empty.

16
00:00:52,978 --> 00:00:54,600
Then start the round anyway.

17
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,236
Look at Ana's line three.

18
00:00:57,556 --> 00:00:59,475
Its tiles stayed from last round.

19
00:00:59,796 --> 00:01:01,289
She can still finish it.

20
00:01:03,150 --> 00:01:04,579
Now the round starts.

21
00:01:04,899 --> 00:01:07,822
Ana puts the marker in the centre, and goes first.

22
00:01:08,933 --> 00:01:09,829
Remember.

23
00:01:10,149 --> 00:01:13,008
The marker holder puts four tiles on each display.

24
00:01:13,328 --> 00:01:16,912
If the bag runs empty, pour in the box lid and keep going.

25
00:01:17,231 --> 00:01:19,109
Then the marker holder goes first.

26
00:01:19,429 --> 00:01:21,157
Next: the end of the game.
